---
import {CREATIVE_CHAPTERS,journeyFromSettings} from '../../lib/studio/creatorJourney';
import {chapterDocuments} from '../../lib/studio/chapterDocuments';
import ChapterFoundation from './ChapterFoundation.astro';
import ChapterArchitecture from './ChapterArchitecture.astro';
import ChapterExpression from './ChapterExpression.astro';
import ChapterVisualWorld from './ChapterVisualWorld.astro';
import ChapterCompanion from './ChapterCompanion.astro';
import ChapterCommunityQuestion from './ChapterCommunityQuestion.astro';
import ChapterMaking from './ChapterMaking.astro';
import ChapterPublication from './ChapterPublication.astro';

const {project,cards=[],families=[],guidebook=[],illustrative=false}=Astro.props;
const initial={...journeyFromSettings(project.settings??{}),...chapterDocuments(project.settings??{})};
const base=`/studio/projects/${project.id}`;
const labels={idea:'The idea at its heart',why:'Why I want to create it',contribution:'What I bring to the work',experience:'What I hope someone will experience',principles:'What I want to remain true'};
---
<div class="creative-journey" data-project={project.id} data-owner={project.owner_id} data-updated={project.updated_at}>
 <script type="application/json" id="journey-initial" set:html={JSON.stringify(initial).replaceAll('<','\\u003c')}/>
 <header class="journey-heading"><p class="studio-eyebrow">My Journey</p><h1 data-journey-title>Develop your deck idea</h1><p data-journey-lede>Plan, write and design your deck across eight Sections.</p></header>
 
 <nav class="chapter-trail" aria-label="Creative Sections">{CREATIVE_CHAPTERS.map((c,i)=><button type="button" data-chapter={c.id}><span>{i+1}</span>{c.name}</button>)}</nav>
 <div class="journey-columns"><main id="journey-work">
 <section data-chapter-panel="spark">
 <nav class="spark-moments" aria-label="The Spark moments">{['Welcome','Current progress','Your idea','Your voice','North Star'].map((name,i)=><button type="button" data-moment={i}>{name}</button>)}</nav>
 <section data-moment-panel="0"><p class="studio-eyebrow">Section one · The Spark</p><h2>Describe the deck you want to create</h2><p><a href={`/studio/projects/${project.id}/guidebook-outline/`}>Set up your card entries</a></p><p class="journey-opening">Perhaps it is an idea you have carried for years. An experience you want to share. A way of understanding the world that you have never quite found expressed in someone else's cards.</p><p>Whatever has brought you here, it deserves the opportunity to become something of its own.</p>
<button type="button" class="studio-button" data-next="1">Begin with your idea</button><p>No need to have everything figured out.</p></section>
 <section data-moment-panel="1" hidden><h2>Where are you with your idea?</h2><p>Choose the closest starting point. It won't limit what you can create.</p><label class="studio-field">How much have you developed so far?<select data-response="startingPlace"><option value="">Still exploring</option><option value="idea">An idea is beginning to take shape.</option><option value="notes">I have notes, writing, images, or card ideas already.</option><option value="underway">My deck is underway, but I need help bringing it together.</option><option value="advanced">Much of my deck is developed, and I am thinking about finishing or publishing it.</option></select></label><p id="starting-context" class="context-note"></p><details><summary>What perspective are you bringing to this? (optional)</summary><label class="studio-field">Your background<select data-response="background"><option value="">Prefer to leave this open</option><option value="personal">I'm exploring something personally meaningful.</option><option value="reader">I read tarot, oracle, or other card systems.</option><option value="creative">I'm an artist, writer, or creative practitioner.</option><option value="professional">I'm a coach, therapist, educator, or other professional.</option><option value="combined">My background is something else, or a combination.</option></select></label><label class="studio-field">Anything you would like to add<textarea data-response="backgroundNotes" rows="4"/></label></details></section>
 <section data-moment-panel="2" hidden><h2>What is the idea that keeps bringing you back?</h2><p>It may be a subject, a story, a feeling, a system of knowledge, a visual world, or something you have not yet found the words to describe. Begin wherever it feels natural.</p><label class="studio-field">The heart of your idea<textarea data-response="heart" rows="9" placeholder="A few words, fragments, or a fuller reflection…"/></label><details><summary>A few prompts, if they help</summary>{[['inspiration','What first inspired the idea?'],['why','Why does it matter to you?'],['experience','What would you love someone to discover or experience through these cards?']].map(([key,label])=><label class="studio-field">{label}<textarea data-response={key} rows="4"/></label>)}</details></section>
 <section data-moment-panel="3" hidden><h2>Finding your voice</h2><p>You can explore any of these questions, or leave them for later. This is about what you bring to the work, before choosing its visual style.</p>{[['perspective','What do you notice, understand, or experience about this subject that you most want to share?'],['connection','What personal experiences, professional knowledge, cultural influences, or creative interests have shaped this idea?'],['expression','How would you like someone to feel when they encounter your cards and the words you write about them?'],['principles','Are there qualities, principles, or meanings you would not want to lose as the project develops?']].map(([key,label])=><details><summary>{label}</summary><label class="studio-field">Your reflection<textarea data-response={key} rows="5"/></label></details>)}</section>
 <section data-moment-panel="4" hidden><p class="studio-eyebrow">An evolving statement of intention</p><h2>My Creative North Star</h2><p>Your original responses remain separate. You can bring your own words into this document, then edit each part in your own way.</p><button type="button" class="studio-button studio-button--secondary" id="use-originals">Use my words</button><p id="copy-notice" role="status"></p>{Object.entries(labels).map(([key,label])=><label class="studio-field">{label}<textarea data-north-star={key} rows="4" placeholder=""/></label>)}<details><summary>Your original reflections</summary><div id="original-reflections"/></details><details><summary>Earlier saved North Stars</summary><div id="north-star-history"/></details><h3>Your idea has somewhere to belong.</h3><p>You've begun to give shape to the vision behind your deck. You don't need every answer yet. The Creative North Star will remain here as your project grows.</p><button class="studio-button" type="button" data-chapter="foundation">Explore The Foundation</button></section>
 <div class="journey-actions"><button type="button" class="studio-button" id="save-journey">Save my reflections</button><button type="button" class="studio-button studio-button--secondary" id="next-moment">Continue</button></div>
 </section>
 <ChapterFoundation base={base}/><ChapterArchitecture project={project} illustrative={illustrative} base={base} cards={cards} families={families} guidebook={guidebook}/>
 <ChapterExpression project={project} cards={cards} families={families}/><ChapterVisualWorld project={project} cards={cards} families={families}/>
 <ChapterCompanion project={project} cards={cards} sections={guidebook}/>
 <ChapterMaking project={project} cards={cards} sections={guidebook}/><ChapterPublication project={project}/>
 <ChapterCommunityQuestion/><p id="journey-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Your reflections are private to this project.</p>
 </main><aside class="journey-rail"><section class="rail-studio"><p class="studio-eyebrow">A studio prompt</p><h2 data-context-title>Begin with curiosity</h2><p data-context-note>You do not need to know the whole deck yet. Start with what draws you here.</p></section><section class="rail-support"><h2>People and support</h2><p><a href="/studio/community/">Community</a></p><p><a href={`${base}/editorial/`}>Confidential editorial support</a></p><p><a href="/studio/account/">My support and services</a></p></section><section class="rail-context"><p class="studio-eyebrow">Your working document</p><h2 data-output-name>Creative North Star</h2><p id="current-location">The Spark</p><a href={`${base}/journal/`}>Keep a thought in my private journal</a><details><summary>How I like to work</summary><label class="studio-field">Guidance<select id="guidance"><option value="guided">Show supporting guidance</option><option value="independent">Keep supporting guidance out of the way</option></select></label><p id="guidance-help">This choice shows or hides the supporting prompt beside your work. Your fields, Save and optional field help stay available.</p></details></section></aside></div>
</div>
<script>import '../../scripts/creatorJourney';import '../../scripts/studioJourneyLayout';</script>
<style>
.journey-output-links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.75rem 1.5rem;margin:1rem 0}.journey-output-links a{display:inline-block;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.2em}

.creative-journey .journey-heading{padding:.4rem 0 .9rem}.creative-journey .journey-heading h1{font-size:clamp(1.7rem,2.8vw,2.55rem);margin:.2rem 0;line-height:1.15}.creative-journey .journey-heading p{margin:.3rem 0}.creative-journey .chapter-trail{border-top:1px solid #cec9c1;padding:.6rem 0 1rem}.creative-journey .chapter-trail button{font-size:.82rem}.creative-journey .chapter-trail button[aria-current] span{background:var(--chapter-accent);color:#fff}.creative-journey .chapter-trail button[aria-current]{color:#242b2b}.creative-journey .journey-rail section{padding:1rem 1.15rem}.creative-journey .journey-rail h2{font-size:1.35rem}.creative-journey .journey-rail p{font-size:.91rem}.creative-journey .journey-columns{gap:1.6rem}:global(.studio-page:has(.creative-journey)){padding-top:1.5rem}@media(max-width:760px){.creative-journey .journey-heading h1{font-size:1.9rem}}
.creative-journey{--journey-ochre:#8a6a1f;color:#242b2b}.journey-heading{max-width:850px;padding:1.4rem 0 2rem}.journey-heading h1{font:clamp(2.2rem,4vw,3.5rem)/1.12 'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;margin:.4rem 0 1rem}.chapter-trail{display:flex;gap:.7rem;overflow:auto;padding:.8rem 0 1.4rem;border-top:3px solid #b6c6cb}.chapter-trail button{flex:0 0 130px;text-align:left;background:transparent;border:0;color:inherit;padding:.4rem;font:inherit;line-height:1.3}.chapter-trail span{display:block;border:1px solid #91846d;border-radius:50%;width:1.8rem;height:1.8rem;text-align:center;line-height:1.7rem;margin-bottom:.5rem}.chapter-trail button[aria-current]{color:#715211;font-weight:700}.chapter-trail button[aria-current] span{background:#e7dab8}.journey-columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,2fr) minmax(250px,1fr);gap:2.2rem;align-items:start}#journey-work{background:#faf8f3;border:1px solid #cec9c1;padding:clamp(1.2rem,3vw,2.5rem);border-radius:5px;min-width:0}.creative-journey h2{font:clamp(1.75rem,3vw,2.5rem)/1.2 'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif}.creative-journey p{line-height:1.7}.journey-opening{font-size:1.18rem}.journey-illustration{width:100%;height:auto;margin:1rem 0}.small-note{font-size:.8rem;color:#58605d}.spark-moments{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem;margin-bottom:2rem}.spark-moments button{border:0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;background:none;padding:.5rem .4rem;font:inherit;color:inherit}.spark-moments button[aria-current]{border-color:#8a6a1f;font-weight:700}.journey-rail{display:grid;gap:1.2rem}.journey-rail section{padding:1.4rem;border-radius:4px}.rail-studio{background:#e8e0d2}.rail-context{background:#e0e9e9}.rail-journey{background:#e8e3ee}.journey-rail h2{font-size:1.6rem}.creative-journey .studio-field{display:grid;gap:.55rem;margin:1.2rem 0;font-weight:600}.creative-journey textarea,.creative-journey select{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;font:400 1rem/1.6 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;padding:.8rem;background:white;border:1px solid #9d9e94;border-radius:4px;color:#242b2b}.creative-journey textarea{resize:vertical}.creative-journey details{border-top:1px solid #cec9c1;padding:1rem 0}.creative-journey summary{cursor:pointer;line-height:1.5;font-weight:600}.journey-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.7rem;margin-top:2rem}.creative-journey .studio-button{min-height:2.85rem;box-sizing:border-box;font:600 .95rem/1.3 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;padding:.7rem 1rem;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.journey-text-link{display:block;margin:1rem 0}.creative-journey button:focus-visible,.creative-journey a:focus-visible,.creative-journey summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #065e73;outline-offset:3px}.context-note{border-left:3px solid #b4bdad;padding-left:1rem}.creative-journey [hidden]{display:none!important}#journey-status{border-top:1px solid #cec9c1;padding-top:1rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.creative-journey[data-guidance=independent] .journey-rail .rail-studio{display:none}#original-reflections p,#north-star-history p{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}@media(max-width:760px){.journey-columns{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1rem}.journey-rail{grid-template-columns:1fr}.journey-heading{padding-top:.5rem}.chapter-trail button{flex-basis:115px}.journey-actions .studio-button{width:100%}}
</style>
<style>
.creative-journey .studio-button--secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid #8a6a1f;color:#594314}.creative-journey .studio-button--secondary:hover{background:#ece4d2}.chapter-trail button{align-self:stretch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start}.chapter-trail button span{flex:none}.chapter-trail:focus-within{scroll-behavior:smooth}
.creative-journey :global(.studio-button){min-height:2.85rem;box-sizing:border-box;font:600 .95rem/1.3 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;padding:.7rem 1rem;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.creative-journey :global(.studio-button--secondary){background:transparent;border:1px solid #8a6a1f;color:#594314}.creative-journey :global([hidden]){display:none!important}
</style>

<style>
.journey-heading{max-width:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:.25rem 1rem;padding:.45rem 0 1rem;align-items:center}.journey-heading .studio-eyebrow,.journey-heading h1,.journey-heading p{grid-column:1;margin:.2rem 0}.journey-heading h1{font-size:clamp(1.7rem,2.8vw,2.55rem)}.journey-heading a{grid-column:2;grid-row:1/4}.chapter-trail{gap:0;padding:.7rem 0 1rem;border-top:1px solid #cec9c1}.chapter-trail button{flex:1 0 102px;font-size:.79rem;padding:.3rem .4rem;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;position:relative}.chapter-trail button:before{content:'';position:absolute;left:2.4rem;right:0;top:1.2rem;height:1px;background:#cec9c1}.chapter-trail button:last-child:before{display:none}.chapter-trail button span{width:1.6rem;height:1.6rem;line-height:1.5rem;margin-bottom:.35rem;border-color:var(--chapter-accent)}.chapter-trail button:nth-child(8n+1){--chapter-accent:#8a6a1f}.chapter-trail button:nth-child(8n+2){--chapter-accent:#58705b}.chapter-trail button:nth-child(8n+3){--chapter-accent:#496f80}.chapter-trail button:nth-child(8n+4){--chapter-accent:#7a647c}.chapter-trail button:nth-child(8n+5){--chapter-accent:#955f50}.chapter-trail button:nth-child(8n+6){--chapter-accent:#526b7a}.chapter-trail button:nth-child(8n+7){--chapter-accent:#5c735a}.chapter-trail button:nth-child(8n){--chapter-accent:#8a6a1f}.chapter-trail button[aria-current]{color:#242b2b;border-bottom-color:var(--chapter-accent)}.chapter-trail button[aria-current] span{background:var(--chapter-accent);color:white}.journey-columns{gap:1.6rem;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,2fr) minmax(240px,1fr)}#journey-work{padding:clamp(1.1rem,2.4vw,2rem)}.journey-rail{gap:.8rem}.journey-rail section{padding:1.1rem 1.2rem}.journey-rail h2{font-size:1.35rem;margin:.4rem 0}.journey-rail p{font-size:.91rem;margin:.6rem 0}.journey-rail details{padding:.6rem 0 0;margin-top:.8rem}.journey-rail :global(.rail-foundations){padding:.85rem 1.1rem!important;background:#e8e3ee!important}.journey-rail :global(.rail-foundations summary){font-size:.9rem}.journey-rail :global(.rail-foundations p){margin:.5rem 0}.journey-rail :global(.rail-foundations button){background:none;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #9d9e94;padding:.25rem 0;min-height:0;justify-content:start;font-size:.88rem}.creative-journey[data-guidance=independent] .rail-studio{display:none}@media(max-width:760px){.journey-heading{grid-template-columns:1fr}.journey-heading a{grid-column:1;grid-row:auto;justify-self:start;margin-top:.5rem}.chapter-trail button{flex:0 0 98px}.journey-columns{grid-template-columns:1fr}.journey-rail{grid-template-columns:1fr}.journey-heading h1{font-size:1.9rem}}
</style>





<style>.rail-support{background:#edf0e7}.rail-support p{margin:.5rem 0}.journey-heading p{max-width:70ch}.journey-heading{padding-bottom:.7rem}.creative-journey .studio-copy-recovery{padding:1rem;border:1px solid #b79a51}</style>

<style>.journey-heading{padding:.5rem 0 .75rem;max-width:100%}.journey-heading h1{font-size:clamp(1.7rem,2.7vw,2.4rem);margin:.3rem 0}.journey-heading p{margin:.4rem 0}.spark-moments,.chapter-moments{margin-bottom:1rem}.chapter-trail{margin-block:.75rem;padding:.6rem 0 .8rem}</style>

<style>
.creative-journey .journey-heading{padding:.25rem 0 .5rem}.creative-journey .journey-heading h1{margin:.15rem 0}.creative-journey .chapter-trail{margin:.35rem 0;padding:.35rem 0 .5rem}.creative-journey #journey-work{padding:1.25rem}.creative-journey :global(.chapter-moments),.creative-journey .spark-moments{margin-bottom:.5rem}.creative-journey :global([data-document-panel]>h2){margin:.4rem 0;font-size:clamp(1.6rem,2.3vw,2rem)}.creative-journey :global([data-document-panel]>p){margin:.5rem 0;line-height:1.55}.creative-journey :global(.studio-field){margin:.85rem 0}.creative-journey :global(.chapter-actions),.creative-journey .journey-actions{position:sticky;bottom:0;background:#faf8f3;padding:.65rem 0;margin-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid #cec9c1;z-index:2}
@media(max-width:760px){.creative-journey #journey-work{padding:1rem}.creative-journey .chapter-trail button{flex-basis:98px}.creative-journey :global(.chapter-actions),.creative-journey .journey-actions{position:static}}
</style>

<style>
.creative-journey .journey-heading{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:.5rem 1rem;flex-wrap:wrap}.creative-journey .journey-heading .studio-eyebrow{flex-basis:100%;margin:0}.creative-journey .journey-heading h1{font-size:1.9rem}.creative-journey .journey-heading p[data-journey-lede]{font-size:.95rem;margin:.25rem 0}.creative-journey :global(.chapter-moments){flex-wrap:nowrap;overflow-x:auto;gap:.4rem}.creative-journey :global(.chapter-moments button){white-space:nowrap;flex-shrink:0;min-height:44px}.creative-journey :global([data-document-panel]>p:not(.studio-eyebrow)){max-width:65ch}.creative-journey .chapter-trail{margin:.25rem 0}.creative-journey :global([data-document-panel][data-step="5"]>p:not(.studio-eyebrow)){font-size:.95rem}
</style>

<style>.creative-journey .journey-heading{display:block!important;margin-bottom:.25rem}.creative-journey .journey-heading h1{font-size:1.9rem!important;margin:.2rem 0!important}.creative-journey .journey-heading .studio-eyebrow{margin:0!important}.creative-journey .chapter-trail{margin-block:.35rem!important}</style>

<style>.creative-journey :global(.architecture-actions),.creative-journey :global(.making-actions),.creative-journey :global(.launch-actions){position:sticky;bottom:0;z-index:2;background:#faf8f3;padding:.65rem 0;border-top:1px solid #cec9c1;margin-top:1rem}.creative-journey :global(.studio-step-context){padding:.35rem 0;margin:.35rem 0}.creative-journey :global(.architecture-moments),.creative-journey :global(.making-moments),.creative-journey :global(.launch-moments){display:flex;flex-wrap:nowrap;overflow-x:auto;gap:.4rem;margin-bottom:.5rem}.creative-journey :global(.architecture-moments button),.creative-journey :global(.making-moments button),.creative-journey :global(.launch-moments button){white-space:nowrap;flex-shrink:0;min-height:44px}@media(max-width:760px){.creative-journey .journey-heading p[data-journey-lede]{margin-bottom:.2rem}.creative-journey .chapter-trail{padding-block:.25rem}.creative-journey :global(.chapter-actions),.creative-journey .journey-actions{position:sticky;bottom:0;z-index:2;background:#faf8f3}}</style>

<style>@media(max-width:760px){.creative-journey .journey-heading p[data-journey-lede]{display:none}.creative-journey :global(.chapter-actions),.creative-journey .journey-actions{position:sticky!important;bottom:0;display:flex;flex-wrap:nowrap;gap:.5rem}.creative-journey :global(.chapter-actions .studio-button),.creative-journey .journey-actions .studio-button{width:auto;flex:1;min-width:0;padding:.7rem .6rem}.creative-journey :global(textarea),.creative-journey :global(input),.creative-journey :global(select){scroll-margin-block:6rem}}</style>

<style>@media(max-width:760px){.creative-journey #journey-work :global(h2){margin:.4rem 0}.creative-journey :global(.making-actions),.creative-journey :global(.launch-actions),.creative-journey :global(.architecture-actions){display:flex;flex-wrap:nowrap;gap:.5rem}.creative-journey :global(.making-actions .studio-button),.creative-journey :global(.launch-actions .studio-button),.creative-journey :global(.architecture-actions .studio-button){width:auto;flex:1;min-width:0;padding:.7rem .6rem}}</style>
